### organization-service — example requests
# organization/organization-service-with-loco — loco-idiomatic layout
# (src/controllers/). Envelope: BARE loco JSON — a success body is the
# resource/array itself, no wrapper; non-2xx is loco's own
# {"error":"...","description":"..."} (ErrorDetail). Gated by
# ORGANIZATION_REQUIRE_AUTH (default off). The API DTO IS the matcher's
# Organization type, stored verbatim as JSONB.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8087
@orgPid = REPLACE_WITH_PID_FROM_CREATE
# curl-verified example: creating the body below in a local run produced
# pid 63c5dbda-72ae-4ca8-b65e-927191e9ed87 — every id is server-minted
# and different per run, so copy your own create response's "pid".
@token = REPLACE_WITH_BEARER_FROM_00-auth-handshake.http


### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/_health


### Who am I — always requires a valid bearer token (curl-verified 401
# with none, regardless of ORGANIZATION_REQUIRE_AUTH).
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/organizations/whoami
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Create an organization — minimal valid body.
# curl-verified response: {"pid":"<uuid>","name":"Acme, Inc."}
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/organizations
Content-Type: application/json
Accepts-version: 1.0

{
  "name": "Acme, Inc.",
  "legal_name": "Acme Incorporated",
  "url": "https://acme.com",
  "same_as": ["https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q42"],
  "jurisdiction": "US",
  "founding_date": "1985-04-01",
  "keywords": ["anvils"]
}


### Get the created organization back (the full stored DTO)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/organizations/{{orgPid}}


### List organizations — paginated; curl-verified response headers
# X-Total-Count / X-Limit / X-Offset (agents/share/restful.md).
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/organizations?limit=25&offset=0


### Search — fuzzy + phonetic full-text via Tantivy
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/organizations/search?q=Acme&fuzzy=true&phonetic=true&limit=10


### Update an organization
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/organizations/{{orgPid}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Acme, Inc.",
  "legal_name": "Acme International Incorporated",
  "url": "https://acme.com",
  "jurisdiction": "US",
  "founding_date": "1985-04-01",
  "keywords": ["anvils", "rockets"]
}


### Probabilistic + deterministic match — score a candidate without creating
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/organizations/match
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Acme, Inc.", "jurisdiction": "US" }


### Explicit duplicate check — curl-verified: bare `[]` when no candidates
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/organizations/check-duplicates
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Acme, Inc." }


### Batch deduplicate — scans the whole index, populates the review queue
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/organizations/deduplicate


### Review queue — curl-verified shape: {"items":[...],"total":n}
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/organizations/review-queue?status=pending


### Review queue — decide a pending item
# POST {{baseUrl}}/api/organizations/review-queue/{{reviewId}}/decision
# Content-Type: application/json
#
# { "status": "confirmed" }


### Merge two confirmed-duplicate organizations (destructive)
# POST {{baseUrl}}/api/organizations/merge
# Content-Type: application/json
#
# { "main_pid": "{{orgPid}}", "duplicate_pid": "<other-uuid>" }


### Recent merges
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/organizations/merges/recent


### Masked view (privacy.md)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/organizations/{{orgPid}}/masked


### GDPR export
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/organizations/{{orgPid}}/export


### Audit trail for this record
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/organizations/{{orgPid}}/audit


### Recent audit log (system-wide) — curl-verified: array of
# {created_at,updated_at,id,entity_pid,action,actor,snapshot,hash,...}
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/organizations/audit/recent


### Bulk import (JSONL/CSV) — 202 Accepted, returns a job id
# POST {{baseUrl}}/api/organizations/import
# Content-Type: application/json
#
# { "format": "jsonl", "dedupe_mode": "upsert" }


### Bulk export
# POST {{baseUrl}}/api/organizations/export
# Content-Type: application/json
#
# { "format": "csv" }


### FHIR R5 — read this organization as an Organization resource (the
# reference FHIR implementation for the family, agents/share/fhir.md)
GET {{baseUrl}}/fhir/Organization/{{orgPid}}


### Delete (soft-delete) an organization
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/organizations/{{orgPid}}
